Carafe bench: when a producer disconnects from a layer, the compositor drops the frame it kept.
The kept frame held a duplicate of the nvmap handle, so the buffer stayed mapped for the GPU after
the game freed its memory and reused it for new GPU buffers.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as the files it changes.

